# Line-ending law (DEC-104 family — legibility is a security property, Tenshi):
# code is LF by construction, so a whole-file CRLF flip can never again ride
# silently inside a feature diff (the a62e0dd orchestrator lesson).
# Historical documents (.md session-notes, logs) carry NO rule — byte-preserved
# as committed (the DEC-069 posture: records keep their original form).
*.ts   text eol=lf
*.tsx  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
